# examples/Dockerfile builds from the repository root because the examples
# module replaces the library with ../. Keep the build context to what a Go
# build can use: docs/ alone carries a node_modules tree far larger than the
# rest of the repository.
.git/
.claude/
.github/
.vscode/
docs/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/bin/
coverage.txt
custom-gcl
*.test
*.out
